tail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize. Without `size`, the lockup follows the\nsurrounding size scope. A tier is the same at every container width."],[1192,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[671,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[1896,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[675,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1461,"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."],[1728,"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"],[1699,"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."],[1239,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1794,"**Arrow Left / Right**"],[1400,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[928,"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a submenu"],[927,"**Arrow Up/Down**: move between items; **Home/End**: first/last"],[1240,"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"],[1917,"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"],[668,"**Automatic caching**: Once loaded, icons are cached for optimal performance"],[722,"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"],[1913,"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"],[1912,"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"],[673,"**Bento integration**: Extends Bento Icon with additional Antares-specific features"],[1915,"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"],[1818,"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."],[2049,"**Chart container:** `data-width`, `data-height`, `data-x-labels`, `data-y-labels`, `data-x-labels-vertical`, `data-x-baseline`, `data-y-baseline`, `data-x-tick-marks`, `data-y-tick-marks`"],[746,"**Check browser console**: Look for network errors"],[1951,"**Check container**: Ensure the chart container is not transformed or positioned in a complex layout"],[1946,"**Check data**: Ensure `series` array has data and `xAccessor`/`yAccessor` return valid values"],[1948,"**Check dimensions**: Ensure container has non-zero width and height"],[1947,"**Check domains**: Verify `yDomain` (if set) includes your data values"],[744,"**Check icon name**: Ensure the icon exists in the CDN"],[1950,"**Check scroll position**: The component accounts for horizontal scroll automatically"],[332,"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[331,"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[730,"**Client-Side Hydration**: The sprite sheet is generated and injected after hydration, causing a brief paint event"],[670,"**Color inheritance**: Uses `currentColor` by default for seamless theme integration"],[1727,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"],[790,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `DatePickerCalendar`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in. `children` also accepts a function for picker state"],[1348,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1017,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1350,"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"],[881,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[741,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[879,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[1021,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1352,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1730,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1700,"**Controls keep the scale size.** A `Button` inside a lockup follows the surrounding\n`SizeProvider` or its own `size` prop, never the lockup's tier."],[1729,"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"],[2109,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[1894,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[1893,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[1955,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[729,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[1891,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[731,"**DOM Output:**"],[1800,"**End**"],[676,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1695,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[747,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[735,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[720,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[669,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1355,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[723,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1914,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1926,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1798,"**Home**"],[1929,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1918,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[2108,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[2099,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[698,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[738,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[1892,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[337,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[336,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[1921,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[880,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1817,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[1954,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[734,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[1916,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[751,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[1920,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1731,"**Multiline**: Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry"],[745,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[1191,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[667,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[732,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[749,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[742,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[1236,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[1235,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[882,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1356,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation