ntage formatting, for when the X values are names rather than numbers or dates."],[1910,"A category missing from the map falls back to the series' own default color. `Marketplace`\nand `Gift Cards` are both absent from `categoryColors`, so each period draws them in that\nperiod's default palette color instead of a shared channel color — showing the sparse-map\nfallback alongside the mapped channels."],[386,"A ChipGroup has no accessible name"],[430,"A circular progress indicator shows determinate or indeterminate progress of an operation over time"],[2,"A collection of accessible, composable React components built on React Aria."],[2143,"A common navigation bar pattern using space-between and nested Flex containers."],[2182,"A common two-column form pattern with auto-sized label column."],[1426,"A component's own `size` prop wins for that component only."],[1435,"A component's own `size` wins for that component and every part inside it, such as a field's\nlabel and description. Its siblings keep following the scope."],[388,"A composed label is not truncating correctly"],[1033,"A composed pagination primitive for controlled or uncontrolled page navigation."],[2075,"A continuous gauge with a single label."],[1055,"A controlled Pagination keeps the current page in consumer state."],[1225,"A controlled radio group using `value` and `onChange`."],[1137,"A determinate progress bar with a label and helper text."],[1175,"A disabled interactive step is muted, not focusable, and cannot be activated."],[805,"A disabled picker via `isDisabled`."],[1503,"A disabled switch prevents interaction and renders at reduced opacity, whether off or on."],[1858,"A flexible, accessible, and design-aligned data visualization solution for displaying single or multi-series bar charts."],[178,"A fully disabled calendar."],[1171,"A horizontal stepper. `currentStep` marks the active step; earlier steps are `past`, later are `future`. Each `status` sets the step's icon, and an `error` step turns i